Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 17:27:11 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] Always quip on income, and on replies that fill in a missing
 amount

- New income always gets a Frankie quip; expenses stay at 35%.
- Replying with the amount to an *AMOUNT NEEDED* message completes a new
  transaction, so it follows the same quip rule (pooled quip).
- persona.Picker.Lang remembers each user's last language, so a bare
  amount reply like "509589" isn't answered in English by default.

